# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) and other agent
toolchains when working with code in this repository. It is the **binding**: what
is true of *this* repo. Portable doctrine lives in `docs/rules/*` and is pulled
from the governance kit — refinements to it are promoted upstream, not edited
here (see `docs/rules/governance.md` "Kit propagation").

